**trigger.hpp models analog trigger readings.**

## API

`trigger_side:uint8_t{left,right}`; `trigger_count:size_t=2`; `to_string(trigger_side) noexcept→const char*`; `trigger_sample{raw:uint16_t=0,normalized:float=0.0f}`.

## Contract

`raw` retains 0..255 units; `normalized` is post-deadzone [0,1]; pressed mapping stays external. Depends on `types.hpp`, `utility.hpp`.